# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here.
# That keeps out .git, .venv, tests, docs, caches, .env, logs, uv.lock and
# anything added later.
*

!pyproject.toml
!quorum/

# Caches inside the package (hatchling has no .gitignore to go by in here).
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
